{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">  <strong>Assault the Sister in the night!\u00a0POV simulation H-game!</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;Doujin Fever!! Night Assault!\u00a0Ver 1.1.2&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The situation is where the Sister/Nun stays the night at your Inn every day. She is always tired from the journey and rests in your Inn. You are charmed by her cuteness, so you can't resist assaulting her in the night! She's so defenseless while sleeping!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>[Objective]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your goal is to assault her without waking her up. If she wakes up during the assault, the game is over. However, you can try again the following night! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>[Easy Gameplay]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game has no penalties, even if you wake her up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>[Character]</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Adelle</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A Sister who is working to cure village diseases. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Birthday: January 18th </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Height: 155cm </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Weight: Secret\u2661</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194110/extras/11.png?t=1743306968\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>[Content &amp; Features]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>[H-Scene]</strong> </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Missionary position with many action possibilities! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">More than 50 actions you can do.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>[Smooth animation]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Animated with Spine2D technology (<strong>1280p 60fps</strong>).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>[Camera Effect]</strong> </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">POV Camera Effects </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Camera shake Night-to-morning transition/vice-versa. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> <strong>[Appearance change]</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hairstyle Hair Color Eye color Panties Socks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194110/extras/appearanceRev.png?t=1743306968\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>X-ray/Cross-Section view in different spots!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194110/extras/illusBlow.png?t=1743306968\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Reveal her naughty side!</strong>  <br>Restraints!  <br>Assault her mouth!  <br>Make her messy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194110/extras/fera.png?t=1743306968\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194110/extras/fera2.png?t=1743306968\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194110/extras/shibari.png?t=1743306968\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194110/extras/shibari2.png?t=1743306968\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3194110?t=1743306968","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194110/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1743306968","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194110/14513231c2f6bd188020